the-firm-as-one-program-25 : List Word
the-firm-as-one-program-25 = unlines (cons "- **C2** Research and production are one definition run in two worlds ([P6: Machines, operating systems and fleets as one program through composed handlers (hyperactivity v31 §7)], [P7: One evaluator realizes everything, through C (hyperactivity v31 §9)])." (cons "  A strategy is one definition run under two handlers: a historical world and the live one. The feature computed in research is the same content-addressed object computed in production, and any difference between simulated and real fills is a stated relation instead of a ghost discovered in the profit and loss. What a researcher proves about a signal carries to the deployed artifact through the source-to-machine relation, on a processor through C or on an FPGA." nil))
